Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix Voice Mode TTS autoplay and improve STT accuracy

Unlock audio on Voice Mode click so replies can play after async gaps,
surface playback failures, force English transcription, use a stronger
Whisper decode path, and wait longer before ending utterances.
---
